    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by letting go? like, is the struggle itself the problem? because the more i try to find a reason to keep going, the more exhausted i feel. it feels like i'm just fighting a ghost. if the universe is indifferent... then why am i even struggling to stay in it? it just feels so heavy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
